As you probably know, a lot of people do not like closed doors.
In their current form, they (the doors) detract from the game because
too much time is spent simply opening doors.

I have a patch.  This patch makes all doors of mundane rooms always
open when the room is created.  Secret doors are still closed and/or locked.
Doors can still be closed and locked by the player.

The patch has been sent to the developers so that they can review it
and distribute the patch themselves (sorry for the delay, you'll just have
to grit your teeth a little longer).

Just wanted to let you know.

